# Shared message for the shims and the PreToolUse hook. Sourced, not run.
claudebox_guidance() {
  cat <<'MSG'
This container has no network, and no pip: that command cannot succeed here,
and no flag or mirror will change that.

Install through the sidecar instead. For something you need right now:

    echo "<package>" > .claudebox-install-request
    sleep 5; cat .claudebox-install.log

For something the project should still have next session, add it to
requirements.txt first, then send an empty request:

    touch .claudebox-install-request

Then run Python as ~/venv/bin/python, not python3 - packages install outside
the project directory, so the system interpreter will not see them.

Full detail: ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md, "Installing packages".
MSG
}
